close_reason: "Implemented and tested: a beforeMutation hook refuses mutations to any Environment version referenced by a Run, Generation, Sweep, Benchmark, EvalResult, GateEpisode, or Transfer. The guard runs at the write boundary under the target item lock, intercepting command, SDK, and direct core mutations. 7 new adversarial tests cover the create-allowed, non-Environment-allowed, unreferenced-allowed, referenced-refused (environment field and dependency edge), close-refused, delete-refused, and non-reference-type-allowed paths. All tests revert-proofed. 100/100/100 coverage maintained. All gates pass: build, test, lint, coverage, changelog, release:check, health --strict-exit."
body: ""
